    "Your Own Past, Rising": "Scales with the target Reckoning stacks and does NOT consume them.",
    "A Kindness, Ending": "Execute — bonus damage below half Toughness.",
    "Never Twice": "Cannot be evaded.",
    "The One Gap": "Ignores 40% of the mitigation left after Seams Everywhere.",
    "Already Behind You": "Cannot be evaded.",
    "All At Once": "Reads Armor already stripped: +10% per 10%, max +40%. Leaves the shred in place.",
    "The Thin Blade Falls": "Guaranteed critical.",
    "First Spark, Last Laugh": "Bonus damage if the target is already burning.",
    "Glad Ruin": "Sacrifices own Toughness for damage.",
    "Drown in What You Did": "CONSUMES every Reckoning stack for a finishing burst.",
    "Sentence Passed": "Bonus damage to a target with no buffs remaining.",
    "Mercy at the End": "Execute, scaling further the lower the target Toughness.",
    "Immaculate": "Ignores 40% of the target mitigation.",
    "The Spear Finds It": "Ignores 40% of the mitigation left after Seams Everywhere.",
    "Quicker Than Told": "Acts again immediately if the target is defeated, chaining.",
    "Avalanche": "CONSUMES every Armor-shred stack: each 10% removed becomes +15%, max +60%.",
    "Ironfall": "Ignores 40% of the target mitigation.",
